# Project Context
This is the Leon International website, a marine engineering and ship repair company. The website is built to be significantly better than international competitors (reference: Wärtsilä, Ocean & Brine) and local competitors.

## Tech Stack
- Next.js 14+ (App Router)
- Tailwind CSS v4
- TypeScript
- Framer Motion

## Brand Identity & Design System
- **Primary Colors**: Dark navy headers/heroes with white text for authority.
  - `#071A26` (primary-950)
  - `navy: '#0E2F44'`
  - `ocean: '#2E86C1'`
- **Accent Colors**: Orange ONLY for CTAs and important highlights.
  - `#FAD7A0` (accent-200)
- **Neutral Colors**:
  - `steel: '#5D6D7E'`
  - `lightgray: '#F8F9FA'`
- **Typography**:
  - Headings: Inter or Plus Jakarta Sans (bold, clean, modern)
  - Body: Inter
  - Accent/Numbers: DM Sans or Outfit
- **Design Principles**:
  - Professional photography — avoid generic stock. Use actual ship/workshop/engine imagery.
  - Subtle scroll animations (Framer Motion fade-up on sections).
  - Mobile-first responsive design.
  - Mega menu navigation for Services and Products.

## URL Rules
- All URLs must be flat (no nesting like `/services/ship-repair/` or `/products/engine-parts/`).
- Every URL must have a trailing slash (e.g., `/ship-repair/`).
- Configure `trailingSlash: true` in `next.config.ts`.

## Complete Sitemap
- `/` → Homepage
- `/about/` → About Us
- `/services/` → Services Overview
- `/ship-repair/` → Ship Repair & Dry Docking
- `/mechanical-repair/` → Mechanical Repair & Engineering
- `/electrical/` → Electrical & Electronics
- `/fabrication/` → Fabrication & Welding
- `/ndt-inspection/` → Testing, Inspection & Calibration (NDT)
- `/protective-coatings/` → Protective Coatings & Surface Treatment
- `/hvac/` → HVAC & Refrigeration
- `/specialized/` → Specialized Services
- `/products/` → Products Overview
... plus individual product pages (e.g. `/engine-parts/`, `/mtu-parts/`, etc.)
- `/projects/` → Projects / Portfolio Gallery
- `/contact/` → Contact Us
- `/quote/` → Request a Quote
- `/blog/` → Blog / Resources
- `/blog/[slug]/` → Individual Blog Post

**For detailed content of each page, refer to `Leon_International_Website_Blueprint (1).md`.**
